This product includes patterns and approaches informed by SaasMail
(https://github.com/choyiny/saasmail, Apache License 2.0) — particularly
around Cloudflare Email Workers inbound handling, MIME parsing, and
the rich-text composer. Where specific code is adapted, the source file
is noted in comments.

This product is designed to run as a plugin for EmDash CMS
(https://github.com/emdash-cms/emdash).

This product bundles postal-mime 2.7.4 by Andris Reinman, with a local
attachment byte-preservation patch, under the MIT-0 license.
Upstream: https://github.com/postalsys/postal-mime
The original license is included in vendor/postal-mime-LICENSE.txt.
The byte-preservation patch is patches/postal-mime@2.7.4.patch;
scripts/vendor-mime.mjs generates and verifies vendor/postal-mime.mjs.

This product embeds the Manrope font, copyright 2018 The Manrope Project
Authors, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The license is included in
src/daylight/Manrope-OFL.txt. The variable font comes from
https://github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/manrope and was converted
from TTF to WOFF2 without changing glyphs.
